@startuml
title A — Failover: missing push ACK, SMS, late ACK race
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 210
participant "Coordinator\n+ Scheduler" as C
database "PostgreSQL\nledger" as DB
queue "Kafka + Outbox Relay" as K
participant "Channel adapter" as W
participant "Push provider\n+ app" as Push
participant "SMS-A / SMS-B" as SMS
participant "Receipt API" as R
note over C,Push: Notification already accepted; push attempted; no app ACK.
... absolute push deadline at accepted_at + 2 s ...
C -> DB: Claim due state using row lock + version
DB --> C: No delivery evidence; push result UNKNOWN
C -> DB: Commit reconcile command outbox (bounded deadline)
K -> W: Reconcile command
W -> Push: Lookup stable key / provider ID
Push --> W: No individual delivery proof
W -> DB: Store UNKNOWN and reconciliation result
C -> DB: Recheck evidence; create SMS attempt\n+ command outbox atomically
K -> W: Deliver committed SMS command
W -> DB: Validate terminal state + attempt; acquire permit
alt Evidence committed before SMS permit
  DB --> W: Stop: already delivered
else No evidence at permit time
  DB --> W: SMS permit + stable key
  W -> SMS: Send with stable key
  alt SMS-A proves request was NOT accepted
    SMS --> W: Documented pre-accept rejection
    W -> DB: Record failure
    C -> DB: Authorize SMS-B route (if still open)
    K -> W: SMS-B command
    W -> DB: Check and acquire SMS-B permit
    W -> SMS: Send through SMS-B (new provider key)
    SMS --> W: Accepted + provider ID
  else Accepted by SMS-A
    SMS --> W: Accepted + provider ID
  end
  SMS -> R: Signed device-level delivered DLR
  R -> DB: Dedupe receipt; DELIVERED + evidence
  Push -> R: Late authenticated app ACK
  R -> DB: Append additional evidence; keep DELIVERED
  note over Push,SMS: Both channels may already have reached the user.\nNo new sends; an in-flight external request cannot be reliably recalled.
end
note over W,SMS: Generic 5xx or lost response = UNKNOWN, not proven rejection.\nReconcile using the original key; choose next channel under deadline.
@enduml
